OL,3,GNEWSA'Best game' says teen who watched
OL,4,AFleetwood win from bedroom
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was the best game I have ever
OL,7,Fwatched".
OL,9,FThese are the words of a 14-year-old
OL,10,FFleetwood fan, whose viewing point of
OL,11,FTuesday night's Carabao Cup match went
OL,12,Fviral on social media after being shown
OL,13,Fduring Sky Sports coverage.
OL,15,FMorgan-Lee from Fleetwood in
OL,16,FLancashire, watched his club claim
OL,17,Fvictory over Arsenal from the bedroom
OL,18,Fwindow of a family member's house as it
OL,19,Foverlooked the Highbury stadium.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
